; well [1.5 × 2.29 × 1.55]; market-stall [3.43 × 2.26 × 1.02]; arch [2.84 × 1.48 × 0.68]; brick-wall [2.1 × 1.62 × 0.42]; fountain [2.26 × 1.81 × 2.26]; haystack [1.69 × 1.77 × 1.8]; hitching-post [2 × 1.14 × 0.19]; produce-crate [0.74 × 0.75 × 0.58]; park-bench [1.6 × 0.88 × 0.59]; clothesline [3.12 × 2 × 0.5]; planter [1.02 × 0.7 × 0.42]; water-trough [1.6 × 0.62 × 0.72]; \n### weapons (19)\n\ngreatsword [0.43 × 1.47 × 0.08]; sword [0.3 × 1.01 × 0.09]; axe [0.41 × 0.82 × 0.09]; mace [0.27 × 0.84 × 0.27]; sceptre [0.18 × 0.81 × 0.18]; dagger [0.17 × 0.53 × 0.07]; wand [0.09 × 0.51 × 0.09]; staff [0.2 × 1.77 × 0.13]; bow [0.07 × 1.24 × 0.22]; spear [0.22 × 2 × 0.1]; warhammer [0.51 × 1.39 × 0.2]; crossbow [0.73 × 0.9 × 0.18]; round-shield [0.74 × 0.74 × 0.2]; kite-shield [0.6 × 1.01 × 0.13]; greataxe [0.76 × 1.42 × 0.1]; halberd [0.6 × 2.1 × 0.08]; flail [0.35 × 0.98 × 0.35]; scythe [0.89 × 1.72 × 0.27]; quiver [0.17 × 0.72 × 0.17]; \n\n=== textures: ids\n\n### surfaces (63)\n\nplanks bricks cobbles floor-tiles dirt grass stone flagstones shingles thatch sand snow ice metal-plates rust moss cloth carpet bark leaves parquet rough-boards log-ends wicker marble sandstone basalt slate-tiles ashlar dry-stone pebbles gravel geode ruined-mosaic diagonal-tiles checker-marble hex-tiles mosaic terracotta grate deck slate-roof clay-tiles wood-shakes mud cracked-earth cinders lava-crust swamp shallow-water wet-sand leaf-litter meadow snow-drifts frozen-mud leather burlap chainmail fur scales rune-floor starfield rift-energy \n### sprites (63)\n\ngem-icon coin-spin potion-red potion-blue key scroll gold-icon heart star skull spark smoke-puff spear-icon cloak-icon arrows-icon bomb-icon torch-icon map-icon book-icon coin-pouch-icon meat-icon herb-icon rune-stone-icon fireball-icon frost-nova-icon lightning-bolt-icon poison-cloud-icon heal-icon shield-bubble-icon dash-icon whirlwind-icon leap-icon arrow-volley-icon summon-icon curse-icon aura-icon trap-icon totem-icon arrow-up arro