{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjCAHyFBMiLi4M5D7bGo","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"`PLAN.md` and `planner-exit-interview.json` are written, and the plan covers everything in `TASK.md`; section 17 maps each requirement to the part of the plan that handles it. As `STAGE.md` asked, it leaves the title to each builder and uses no `TASK.md` file or folder names.\n\n**The game it describes**\n- **Genre and setting:** an original gothic co-op action RPG with a fixed 3/4 isometric camera. A cracked bell has woken the dead, and the villain is a saint who was walled up alive.\n- **Content:** three new classes (Bellwarden, Lamplighter, Sexton), each with eight skills and three variations of each. The story is five quests with three bosses, followed by a repeatable run mode with rising difficulty.\n- **Multiplayer:** couch co-op for up to four on one screen when played alone, and shared-world rounds in AI Hub.\n- **For the builder:** a build order, a list of what to cut first and what never to cut, and a test plan behind one command, including a scripted playthrough of the whole game.\n\n**What I tested**\nI ran throwaway builds on this computer so the plan's technical advice is proven. Anything tested is marked \"(verified)\" in the plan:\n- A single HTML file boots on `file://` with WebGPU.\n- The hub harness passes with 2 players, 4 players on a poor network, the host leaving, a copy with no player, and a game-owned card.\n- Custom characters work with all 78 of the engine's animation clips.\n\nThe full game hasn't been built. The balance numbers and content tables are design starting points, not tested values.\n\n**Before builders start**\n1. **The WebGPU flags in `TASK.md` are wrong for this engine:** they lose the GPU device within seconds. The longer list in the kit's `check.mjs` is stable, and the plan tells builders to use it. You may want to correct `TASK.md`.\n2. **\"Multiplayer… for the game on its own\" was ambiguous:** I took it to mean couch co-op. If you meant online play outside the hub, section 12 of the plan needs changing.\n3. **The plan is long:** about 16,000 words, because builders work from it alone. Lower-budget builders will probably need the cut list in section 15.\n\nI deleted my scratch files, including an empty file I accidentally left in `/tmp`, and no browsers of mine are still running. Nothing is committed."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":980,"cache_read_input_tokens":446343,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":980},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9dbc4055-18d5-4f5b-aa46-86fd0623cd25","uuid":"4b8e622d-6b60-4400-be16-a2f78fd0cb3b","timestamp":"2026-11-05T05:01:28.486Z","request_id":"req_011CgjCAHdAcbrDDbPfkf3QS"}
