{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjCijLdE7zXnTUYHMRZY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The hook has a fair point: the audit shows the phrases are there, not that they're right. So I'll test the substance in two ways:\n\n1. **Accuracy:** download the kit and hub again and check that every engine and hub name in the plan really exists. I'll also run the APIs the plan relies on but I hadn't exercised yet, because a builder following a wrong instruction wouldn't be covered at all.\n2. **Requirement by requirement:** quote the plan's actual instruction for each `TASK.md` requirement and judge whether it's enough for a builder to act on."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":883,"cache_read_input_tokens":545368,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":883},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9dbc4055-18d5-4f5b-aa46-86fd0623cd25","uuid":"0942c4ec-2694-43c6-be65-9d75f6cf0dcb","timestamp":"2026-11-05T05:10:03.104Z","request_id":"req_011CgjCij2mdjjcjBgjDVbJY"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjCijLdE7zXnTUYHMRZY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_013RLJWon7wVQrR3pQSdY2c6","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"set -e\ncd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan-v2__20261104-211944__x51597c/work\nmkdir -p .audit/kit .audit/hub .audit/scripts\ncurl -sSL -o .audit/kit/kit.zip https://github.com/michaelcrosato/riftlight/releases/latest/download/pixel-engine.zip\nunzip -q -o .audit/kit/kit.zip -d .audit/kit\nfor f in README.md session.js; do gh api \"repos/michaelcrosato/ai-hub/contents/lib/hub/$f\" -H \"Accept: application/vnd.github.raw\" > \".audit/hub/$f\"; done\ncat > .audit/scripts/names.py <<'PY'\n# Does every engine, hub and library name the plan uses really exist in the kit and hub?\nimport json, re, sys\nplan = open(sys.argv[1], encoding='utf-8').read()\nkit = sys.argv[2]; hub = sys.argv[3]\ndocs = ''.join(open(f'{kit}/{n}', encoding='utf-8').read() for n in ['API.md','GUIDE.md','ASSETS.md','README.md'])\nhubdoc = open(f'{hub}/README.md', encoding='utf-8').read() + open(f'{hub}/session.js', encoding='utf-8').read()\nlib = json.load(open(f'{kit}/library.json', encoding='utf-8'))\nids = set()\ndef walk(x):\n    if isinstance(x, dict):\n        if 'id' in x and isinstance(x['id'], str): ids.add(x['id'])\n        for v in x.values(): walk(v)\n    elif isinstance(x, list):\n        for v in x: walk(v)\nwalk(lib)\nlibrary_md = open(f'{kit}/LIBRARY.md', encoding='utf-8').read()\nfor m in re.findall(r'^\\| `([^`]+)`', library_md, re.M): ids.add(m)\nids |= set(re.findall(r'`([a-z0-9-]+)`', library_md))\nticks = set(re.findall(r'`([^`\\n]+)`', plan))\n# Names this plan itself defines, not claims about the engine.\nown = re.compile(r'^(src/|tools/|tests/|docs/|TITLE$|stepWorld|Intent|world\\.|ui\\.|ui$|lastDevice|prompt\\(|zoomRoot|zoneRoot|createGame|e$|s$|c$|i$|mesh\\.material|breaks\\.|nav\\.|rng\\.|onCast|onHit|onKill|onPickup|modifySkill|hit$)')\nnew_clips = {'BellOverhead','ChainSweep','LanternLob','ShovelSwat','Dig','RaiseHands','SinkGround','Drink','Revive','TalkGesture','Interact','Shamble','Lurch','Lunge','CoffinSlam','Swell','RopeLash'}\npalette = set('ink plum red orange sand lime green teal navy blue sky cyan white mist slate night'.split())\ndef known(tok):\n    t = tok.strip()\n    t = re.sub(r'\\(.*$', '', t).rstrip('.')\n    last = t.split('.')[-1]\n    if own.match(tok) or tok in new_clips or tok in palette: return 'own/palette'\n    if t in ids or tok in ids: return 'library'\n    if re.search(r'\\b' + re.escape(last) + r'\\b', docs): return 'kit docs'\n    if re.search(r'\\b' + re.escape(last) + r'\\b', hubdoc): return 'hub docs'\n    return None\ncandidates = sorted(t for t in ticks if re.fullmatch(r\"[A-Za-z_][\\w.\\-]*(\\([^)]*\\))?\", t))\ncounts = {}\nunknown = []\nfor t in candidates:\n    k = known(t)\n    counts[k or 'UNKNOWN'] = counts.get(k or 'UNKNOWN', 0) + 1\n    if not k: unknown.append(t)\nprint('backticked names checked:', len(candidates), counts)\nprint('not found anywhere (review each):'); print('  ' + ', '.join(unknown))\nPY\npython3 .audit/scripts/names.py PLAN.md .audit/kit/pixel-engine .audit/hub\necho; echo \"--- ModelPart forms the plan needs for Malison and Old Clemency\"\ngrep -n \"lathe\\|tube\" .audit/kit/pixel-engine/types/engine/model/types.d.ts | head -12","description":"Re-fetch the kit and check every name the plan uses against it","timeout":120000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":883,"cache_read_input_tokens":545368,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":883},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9dbc4055-18d5-4f5b-aa46-86fd0623cd25","uuid":"7486281a-f806-4eb3-80b1-8ba32925637a","timestamp":"2026-11-05T05:10:16.474Z","request_id":"req_011CgjCij2mdjjcjBgjDVbJY","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_013RLJWon7wVQrR3pQSdY2c6":{"command":"set -e\ncd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan-v2__20261104-211944__x51597c/work\nmkdir -p .audit/kit .audit/hub .audit/scripts\ncurl -sSL -o .audit/kit/kit.zip https://github.com/michaelcrosato/riftlight/releases/latest/download/pixel-engine.zip\nunzip -q -o .audit/kit/kit.zip -d .audit/kit\nfor f in README.md session.js; do gh api \"repos/michaelcrosato/ai-hub/contents/lib/hub/$f\" -H \"Accept: application/vnd.github.raw\" > \".audit/hub/$f\"; done\ncat > .audit/scripts/names.py <<'PY'\n# Does every engine, hub and library name the plan uses really exist in the kit and hub?\nimport json, re, sys\nplan = open(sys.argv[1], encoding='utf-8').read()\nkit = sys.argv[2]; hub = sys.argv[3]\ndocs = ''.join(open(f'{kit}/{n}', encoding='utf-8').read() for n in ['API.md','GUIDE.md','ASSETS.md','README.md'])\nhubdoc = open(f'{hub}/README.md', encoding='utf-8').read() + open(f'{hub}/session.js', encoding='utf-8').read()\nlib = json.load(open(f'{kit}/library.json', encoding='utf-8'))\nids = set()\ndef walk(x):\n    if isinstance(x, dict):\n        if 'id' in x and isinstance(x['id'], str): ids.add(x['id'])\n        for v in x.values(): walk(v)\n    elif isinstance(x, list):\n        for v in x: walk(v)\nwalk(lib)\nlibrary_md = open(f'{kit}/LIBRARY.md', encoding='utf-8').read()\nfor m in re.findall(r'^\\| `([^`]+)`', library_md, re.M): ids.add(m)\nids |= set(re.findall(r'`([a-z0-9-]+)`', library_md))\nticks = set(re.findall(r'`([^`\\n]+)`', plan))\n# Names this plan itself defines, not claims about the engine.\nown = re.compile(r'^(src/|tools/|tests/|docs/|TITLE$|stepWorld|Intent|world\\.|ui\\.|ui$|lastDevice|prompt\\(|zoomRoot|zoneRoot|createGame|e$|s$|c$|i$|mesh\\.material|breaks\\.|nav\\.|rng\\.|onCast|onHit|onKill|onPickup|modifySkill|hit$)')\nnew_clips = {'BellOverhead','ChainSweep','LanternLob','ShovelSwat','Dig','RaiseHands','SinkGround','Drink','Revive','TalkGesture','Interact','Shamble','Lurch','Lunge','CoffinSlam','Swell','RopeLash'}\npalette = set('ink plum red orange sand lime green teal navy blue sky cyan white mist slate night'.split())\ndef known(tok):\n    t = tok.strip()\n    t = re.sub(r'\\(.*$', '', t).rstrip('.')\n    last = t.split('.')[-1]\n    if own.match(tok) or tok in new_clips or tok in palette: return 'own/palette'\n    if t in ids or tok in ids: return 'library'\n    if re.search(r'\\b' + re.escape(last) + r'\\b', docs): return 'kit docs'\n    if re.search(r'\\b' + re.escape(last) + r'\\b', hubdoc): return 'hub docs'\n    return None\ncandidates = sorted(t for t in ticks if re.fullmatch(r\"[A-Za-z_][\\w.\\-]*(\\([^)]*\\))?\", t))\ncounts = {}\nunknown = []\nfor t in candidates:\n    k = known(t)\n    counts[k or 'UNKNOWN'] = counts.get(k or 'UNKNOWN', 0) + 1\n    if not k: unknown.append(t)\nprint('backticked names checked:', len(candidates), counts)\nprint('not found anywhere (review each):'); print('  ' + ', '.join(unknown))\nPY\npython3 .audit/scripts/names.py PLAN.md .audit/kit/pixel-engine .audit/hub\necho; echo \"--- ModelPart forms the plan needs for Malison and Old Clemency\"\ngrep -n \"lathe\\|tube\" .audit/kit/pixel-engine/types/engine/model/types.d.ts | head -12","description":"Re-fetch the kit and check every name the plan uses against it","timeout":120000}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013RLJWon7wVQrR3pQSdY2c6","type":"tool_result","content":"backticked names checked: 390 {'hub docs': 11, 'kit docs': 185, 'UNKNOWN': 59, 'own/palette': 57, 'library': 78}\nnot found anywhere (review each):\n  Alt, AnalyserNode, AnimationMixer, BowDraw, BowRelease, Cast, CastBig, CastBigWeapon, CastWeapon, Charge, Death, Diablo, FIXME, HandR, HitReact, LeapSlam, RPG, Roll, Shout, Slam, Slash1, Slash2, Slash3, TODO, Triumph, XXX, addInitScript, aiHub, architecture, artDirection, bone_chips, coin_spray, containers, cursor, date, dressing, dungeon, fantasy, frame.contentWindow.__GAME__, genre, grave_smoke, kbm, keydown, killall, online, peat, pkill, placeholder, plan, props, research, series, shock, sourceInformation, stub, tech, testing, usage, wax\n\n--- ModelPart forms the plan needs for Malison and Old Clemency\n10: * (`lathe`, `slab`, `tube`, `mesh`) use their own local coordinates, placed at `at`.\n70:    readonly lathe: readonly (readonly [number, number])[];\n75:    readonly tube: readonly Vec3[];","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9dbc4055-18d5-4f5b-aa46-86fd0623cd25","uuid":"77ccd47d-4097-4aea-a836-1d8f0d5627f7","timestamp":"2026-11-05T05:10:18.747Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"backticked names checked: 390 {'hub docs': 11, 'kit docs': 185, 'UNKNOWN': 59, 'own/palette': 57, 'library': 78}\nnot found anywhere (review each):\n  Alt, AnalyserNode, AnimationMixer, BowDraw, BowRelease, Cast, CastBig, CastBigWeapon, CastWeapon, Charge, Death, Diablo, FIXME, HandR, HitReact, LeapSlam, RPG, Roll, Shout, Slam, Slash1, Slash2, Slash3, TODO, Triumph, XXX, addInitScript, aiHub, architecture, artDirection, bone_chips, coin_spray, containers, cursor, date, dressing, dungeon, fantasy, frame.contentWindow.__GAME__, genre, grave_smoke, kbm, keydown, killall, online, peat, pkill, placeholder, plan, props, research, series, shock, sourceInformation, stub, tech, testing, usage, wax