fter this review found shadows missing.'),\n ('28','Scripted whole-game playthrough','Whole-game playthrough, once per class','Per class, through real menus, with a list of asserts.'),\n ('28','One command, failures and a count','runs everything and prints **only failures','Exactly as asked, with one flag per tier.'),\n ('28','Rerun only when code changes','rerun only the tier','Tier flags make this possible.'),\n ('28','Screenshots only where needed','Use screenshots only for what a script can','A fixed list, for judging looks.'),\n ('28','No review subagents','Don\\'t use subagents or workflows','Stated.'),\n ('52','Stand-in: pad','stubbed `navigator.getGamepads`','A whole flow by pad alone.'),\n ('53','Stand-in: touch','tapping with `page.touchscreen`','Phone and tablet profiles.'),\n ('54','Stand-in: listener','Sound, by what Web Audio produces','Analyser tap on real output, plus renderSound.'),\n ('55','Stand-in: second player','drive P2 by synthetic keys','Beyond the protocol: asserts P2 moves in P1\\'s world.'),\n ('56','Stand-in: iPhone','WebKit here has no WebGPU','Honest limit noted.'),\n ('57','Stand-in: TV','at 1920×1080','10-foot view judged at that size.'),\n ('61-64','Sharing rules','Stay out of the folders beside yours','Restated with the one correction to TASK.md\\'s flags.'),\n ('72','Show ALL features','TASK.md wants every feature shown','Table of 15 rows; tests assert each. Devotion hole fixed via The Last Bell.'),\n ('72','Player understands what they can and can\\'t do','How to Play** in six big pages','Plus contextual tutorial prompts.'),\n ('72','Polished vertical slice','treated as a complete, polished vertical slice','The stated bar, with a feel recipe.'),\n ('72','Infrastructure for designer tools','So the rest of the game can be built later','All content is data, with a recipe page.'),\n ('74','Dev mode from the pause menu','Pause menu → Dev Mode','Pause screen lists it; pad-navigable.'),\n ('74','Standard testing tools','*Spawn:* any mon